From f82088eaea56b2ed8468239b373de25061d55323 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Weidong Sun <sunweidong@linux.alibaba.com>
Date: Wed, 26 Aug 2026 12:43:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] feat(alibabacloud): add crash-resilient ESSD provisioning

Add the Alibaba Cloud ESSD provider with RRSA or explicit credentials, normalized performance-level capacity, deterministic operation tokens and cloud tags, bounded reconciliation, and safe delete/recovery behavior.

Keep all Alibaba chart, credential and recovery wiring in the same commit so the provider is complete when it first appears in history.

Signed-off-by: Weidong Sun <sunweidong@linux.alibaba.com>
---
